 text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E8%8E%AB%E6%BC%A21024.jpg\\\" style=\\\"border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: currentColor; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: currentColor; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: currentColor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; height: 322px; vertical-align: middle; width: 600px;\\\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\\\">經濟日報提供</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<hr style=\\\"background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-image-outset: 0; border-image-repeat: stretch; border-image-slice: 100%; border-image-source: none; border-image-width: 1; border-left-color: currentColor; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 0px; border-right-color: currentColor; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 0px; border-top-color: currentColor; border-top-style: none; border-top-width: 0px; box-sizing: content-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; height: 1px; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 20px; margin-top: 20px; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\" />\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">聯合報系願景工程昨天舉辦「永續能源之路高峰論壇」，邀請<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2007</span>年諾貝爾和平獎共同得主、聯合國政府間氣候變遷問題小組（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">IPCC</span>）前副主席莫漢．芒納星河（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">MOHAN MUNASINGHE</span>）談永續能源發展的平衡發展。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">莫漢指出，世界各國必須把能源政策列為國家政策的一環，追求經濟成長也要兼顧永續發展，不能抱持「現在使用，以後再付錢」的心態。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">他建議台灣的能源規劃要穩健發展、引領公共理解能源議題，也不能犧牲窮人，才能成功。聯合報系董事長王文杉在致詞時表示，冰島悼念第一條因氣候變遷而消失的冰河，樹立了「冰河之死」的紀念碑，科學家認為，過多的二氧化碳，正在對地球造成難以逆轉的傷害。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">王文杉說，台灣燃煤發電的比重仍在近四成的高水位，不僅國人對政府降低二氧化碳排放的成績單不滿意，在國際上，這樣的排碳表現，也讓台灣無法以一個負責任的能源使用國家自居。他期盼藉由高峰論壇，讓更多國人知道自己該做什麼，「在我們這一代就負起責任的走上永續能源之路。」</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">莫漢是芒納星河發展研究所（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">MIND</span>）的創會主席，斯里蘭卡總統<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2030</span>永續願景專家委員會主席兼斯里蘭卡政府名譽資深顧問，北京大學特聘客座教授。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">莫漢表示，台灣人有創意與才華，達到能源發展目標並不難，但在過程中必須穩健發展，不能每幾年就改變能源政策，穩定進行非常重要。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">莫漢也提醒，解決能源與氣候問題無法單兵作戰，要讓社會大眾真正了解能源的問題，光說反核或者是反煤不是永續能源發展的萬靈丹，關於能源的風險必須充分溝通，每個環節都要整合，要讓大眾知道後果會是什麼。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">最後莫漢表示，永續能源發展要平衡，要同時納入經濟、生態、還有社會的發展。發展過程不該讓任何人被遺忘在外，除了滿足社會需求，也不犧牲窮人用電的權益，在改革過程當中，才會有和平與和諧，台灣也有機會扮演東西方的能源樞紐，以及國際要角。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\\\">資料來源：<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">https://money.udn.com/money/story/9554/4120132</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; font-family: &amp;quot;微軟正黑體&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;Microsoft JhengHei&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-top: 0px; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2019-10-24","clk_count":"206"}},"__N_SSG":true}